{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/1cbb622fcd4ad0fa95bec9a68e501219.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/ac9d13234b9a73e9bdaa24232f6733e1.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/ac9d13234b9a73e9bdaa24232f6733e1.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/ac9d13234b9a73e9bdaa24232f6733e1.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Buy your first plot and get to work: cut trees, break rocks, pull weeds, and prep the ground. Use chainsaws, breakers, and tools to shape every inch with your own hands. This is just the beginning.\u00a0<strong>More land will be yours as you grow!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/d637475abd11160c8acdc6329e9c8606.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/2a35bb14d3bc6487889da4c2c33d5f00.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/2a35bb14d3bc6487889da4c2c33d5f00.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/2a35bb14d3bc6487889da4c2c33d5f00.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Place shelves in your store or set up bungalows in your campground. Every structure is shaped by your choices. Plan your outdoor shop from the shelves to the checkout counter, and fill your camp with tents, showers, paths, and decorative touches. Customize every corner and grow your business step by step. <strong>Your store, your camp, your rules!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/e5fcdd5146bd72757b0a8548b5750a79.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/a7f140b3fe3b8448a9943c76b6153766.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/a7f140b3fe3b8448a9943c76b6153766.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/a7f140b3fe3b8448a9943c76b6153766.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Your outdoor store is open for business! Shoppers browse the shelves, pick out what they need, and line up at the register to pay. It\u2019s your job to keep things running ring up sales, restock products, and keep the flow smooth. <strong>Every transaction grows your store, one satisfied customer at a time!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/c825a7bc28a4daa87945c28cebc8a236.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/78f2cd58a2c87861ca8b090f4bc22e42.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/78f2cd58a2c87861ca8b090f4bc22e42.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/78f2cd58a2c87861ca8b090f4bc22e42.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0If you want full shelves, you\u2019ll need to hit the road! <strong>The Hunter Shop</strong> has outdoor gear, the <strong>Supermarket</strong> is stocked with food, the <strong>Hardware Store</strong> offers building materials, and the <strong>Wholesale Store</strong> is perfect for bulk buys. Where you shop and what you bring back is all part of your trade strategy. <strong>Every product, every route. Your call!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3c16b5a32f6351209b69f63de6072ec8.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Whether it's the camp gate or your storefront, your sign is more than just a name it's your signature. Build your signs with a hammer, dust flying as they take shape. Then reveal each letter one by one, bringing your brand to life in real time. <strong>If it's your business, let the world know it with your name on it!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/112f7c71ce588f2196d4b1cff92f434c.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0You don't have to run everything alone. Your workers sweep floors, pick up trash, clean dirty spots, and assist customers at the register. Assign tasks and focus on the bigger picture. <strong>A tidy camp and a smooth-running store start with teamwork!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/174d7137965ae9a0f456c81f9fe11404.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0The vehicle you choose affects how much you can carry. As your business expands, you'll need larger vehicles to move more stock in fewer trips. <strong>Bigger vehicles mean better efficiency and faster growth!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/747d6fd8a1b872b1f52592ea1685467e.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Showers, toilets, hot tubs and fire pits aren't just for looks. Every service your campers use generates passive income for you. Build smart, place them well and let your campground keep earning while you<strong> focus on growing!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/9514bcb7fc0d1ff133937cea13a3595d.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Red Shore Valley is more than just a map. Shops, mountains, forests and the shoreline come together to create a living world. From golden sunsets to cozy nighttime glows, every scene has its own mood. As you manage your business, don't forget to <strong>enjoy the view!</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708070?t=1768941140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/47d411609c187566f6026c85856e76cc7c1b2915/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768941140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/a2c3fca64c5eafebb5270465307d2a551afa51f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768941140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/a2c3fca64c5eafebb5270465307d2a551afa51f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768941140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4087280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/a578b33e165cd7a49cf99ef0743abfe2.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=2090 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class