8 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/78f2cd58a2c87861ca8b090f4bc22e42.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/78f2cd58a2c87861ca8b090f4bc22e42.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0If you want full shelves, you\u2019ll need to hit the road! <strong>The Hunter Shop</strong> has outdoor gear, the <strong>Supermarket</strong> is stocked with food, the <strong>Hardware Store</strong> offers building materials, and the <strong>Wholesale Store</strong> is perfect for bulk buys. Where you shop and what you bring back is all part of your trade strategy. <strong>Every product, every route. Your call!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3c16b5a32f6351209b69f63de6072ec8.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/0d19463b2477aa9df4781cde2df466fd.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Whether it's the camp gate or your storefront, your sign is more than just a name it's your signature. Build your signs with a hammer, dust flying as they take shape. Then reveal each letter one by one, bringing your brand to life in real time. <strong>If it's your business, let the world know it with your name on it!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/112f7c71ce588f2196d4b1cff92f434c.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/33e8e5d04438faa11c2e4e85de07a26d.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0You don't have to run everything alone. Your workers sweep floors, pick up trash, clean dirty spots, and assist customers at the register. Assign tasks and focus on the bigger picture. <strong>A tidy camp and a smooth-running store start with teamwork!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/174d7137965ae9a0f456c81f9fe11404.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/11b904f5fe5c4cc1b174d0020c40f504.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0The vehicle you choose affects how much you can carry. As your business expands, you'll need larger vehicles to move more stock in fewer trips. <strong>Bigger vehicles mean better efficiency and faster growth!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/747d6fd8a1b872b1f52592ea1685467e.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/3cbca01860fdce1f97313156384f00d9.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Showers, toilets, hot tubs and fire pits aren't just for looks. Every service your campers use generates passive income for you. Build smart, place them well and let your campground keep earning while you<strong> focus on growing!</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/9514bcb7fc0d1ff133937cea13a3595d.avif?t=1768941140\" width=800 height=184 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.poster.avif?t=1768941140\" width=628 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.webm?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/extras/57b2779304b7fd3218bb412c8c186d7d.mp4?t=1768941140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2022\u00a0Red Shore Valley is more than just a map. Shops, mountains, forests and the shoreline come together to create a living world. From golden sunsets to cozy nighttime glows, every scene has its own mood. As you manage your business, don't forget to <strong>enjoy the view!</strong>","developers":["RedShore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708070/693003ba4fd0297c0d9e736beb48e63e0f27706f/header.jpg?t=1768941140","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (If the game only works via Rosetta on Intel, please add \u201cIntel only\u201d as noted.)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU or Intel Iris Plus Graphics 645<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Playable on low settings.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Pro / M2 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Pro GPU or equivalent<br></li><li><stron